### Create a post — pre-request script attaches a request timestamp header
< ./../scripts/pre-request-timestamp.js

# @name CREATE_POST
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Time: {{requestTime}}

{
  "title": "My first post",
  "body": "Hello world",
  "meta": {
    "tags": ["intro", "test"],
    "published": false
  }
}

### Fetch the post we just created
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{CREATE_POST.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
